[en.FOCUS_C08_PONIES_WILL]
Will of Ponies

[en.FOCUS_C08_PONIES_WILL_desc]
Since the devastating news of “Jahr Null”, ponies in the resistance have been in high spirits, eager to rush to Canterlot to capture Empress Cozy Glow and execute her thousands of times.\n\nThey are waiting, hoping that Starlight Glimmer could do something to avenge the execution of Twilight.

[zh.FOCUS_C08_PONIES_WILL]
小马们的意志

[zh.FOCUS_C08_PONIES_WILL_desc]
自“新元年”的爆炸性新闻以来，抵抗军的小马们一直情绪高涨，恨不得马上冲到坎特洛特活捉和煦光流，把她处刑成千上万遍。\n\n他们正在等待，希望星光熠熠能做点什么，以报处决之仇。

